    "id": "task2",
    "chapterId": "ch_14",
    "title": "Accessibility Audit & Fix",
    "description": "Review a provided HTML/CSS snippet for accessibility and responsive issues, then fix them.",
    "estimatedMinutes": 15,
    "problemStatement": "Below is a flawed navigation and hero section. Identify and fix the following issues:\n\n1. Missing viewport meta tag.\n2. Navigation lacks semantic `<nav>` element.\n3. Hamburger button is a `<div>` instead of `<button>`, no ARIA.\n4. Hero image missing `alt` text.\n5. Link colour contrast is low (light grey on white).\n6. Focus outline removed without replacement.\n7. Text uses fixed `px` that doesn't scale.\n8. No skip link.\n\nOriginal snippet:\n```html\n<html>\n<head><title>Bad A11y</title>\n<style>\n  body { font-size: 16px; }\n  .navbar { background: #333; padding: 10px; }\n  .nav-links { list-style: none; display: flex; gap: 20px; }\n  .nav-links a { color: #ccc; text-decoration: none; }\n  .menu-btn { cursor: pointer; color: white; font-size: 24px; }\n  .hero img { width: 100%; }\n  *:focus { outline: none; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"navbar\">\n    <div class=\"menu-btn\">&#9776;</div>\n    <ul class=\"nav-links\">\n      <li><a href=\"#\">Home</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#\">About</a></li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero\">\n    <img src=\"hero.jpg\">\n    <h1>Welcome</h1>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>\n```\n\nRewrite the HTML and CSS to address all issues. Use semantic elements, accessible button, proper contrast, alt text, relative units (or at least base font scaling), a skip link, and a visible focus indicator. Keep the same visual design but make it accessible and responsive (basic).\n\nWrite the corrected code.",
    "hints": [
        "Use `<nav>` for navigation.",
        "Hamburger button: `<button class=\"menu-btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-list\">`.",
        "Add `alt=\"Decorative hero image\"` (or meaningful description).",
        "Set `:focus { outline: 3px solid #4A90E2; outline-offset: 2px; }`.",
        "Use `rem` or `em` for font sizes.",
        "Add `<meta name=\"viewport\" ...>`.",
        "Add a skip link before nav."
    ],
    "expectedOutput": "A corrected, accessible, and responsive navigation/hero section.",
    "solutionCode": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Accessible Page</title>\n  <style>\n    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n    body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #333; }\n\n    .skip-link {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: -50px;\n      left: 10px;\n      background: #000;\n      color: #fff;\n      padding: 10px 18px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      z-index: 100;\n      transition: top 0.2s;\n    }\n    .skip-link:focus { top: 10px; }\n\n    nav {\n      background: #333;\n      padding: 10px 1.5rem;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n    }\n    .menu-btn {\n      background: none;\n      border: none;\n      color: white;\n      font-size: 1.8rem;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    .nav-links {\n      list-style: none;\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 1.5rem;\n    }\n    .nav-links a {\n      color: #f0f0f0;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n    .nav-links a:hover { color: #fff; text-decoration: underline; }\n\n    .hero img {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: auto;\n    }\n    .hero h1 {\n      text-align: center;\n      padding: 1rem;\n      font-size: 2rem;\n    }\n\n    /* Visible focus indicator */\n    :focus {\n      outline: 3px solid #ffaa00;\n      outline-offset: 2px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <a href=\"#main-content\" class=\"skip-link\">Skip to main content</a>\n\n  <nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\">\n    <button class=\"menu-btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"nav-list\">&#9776;</button>\n    <ul id=\"nav-list\" class=\"nav-links\">\n      <li><a href=\"#\">Home</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#\">About</a></li>\n    </ul>\n  </nav>\n\n  <main id=\"main-content\">\n    <div class=\"hero\">\n      <img src=\"hero.jpg\" alt=\"Progly app interface on a mobile device\">\n      <h1>Welcome</h1>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
}